{"step": 10, "t": 1791734393.66, "kind": "final_answer", "content": "Dataset (1500 rows, 7 features, churn\u202f\u2248\u202f22%\u202fpositive).  \n\n| Model                | f1_macro |\n|----------------------|----------|\n| Gradient\u202fBoosting    | **0.590** |\n| Random\u202fForest        | 0.582 |\n| K\u2011Nearest\u202fNeighbors  | 0.576 |\n| Decision\u202fTree        | 0.571 |\n| Logistic\u202fRegression  | 0.570 |\n\n**Recommended baseline:** Gradient\u202fBoosting (tuned f1_macro\u202f\u2248\u202f0.61). It balances bias\u2011variance well on this modest, imbalanced churn set and outperforms other families.  \n\n**Top predictive features:** tenure_months, support_calls, contract_two_year (followed by contract_yearly and monthly_charge).  \n\n**Caveat:** The model\u2019s performance is modest; further gains likely need richer features (e.g., usage metrics) or advanced resampling techniques.", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "tokens": 1639}
